# --- SULFUR Build Calculator ---
# This repo IS the public GitHub-Pages deploy surface. Commit ONLY what the
# browser needs to run the site. Everything below stays LOCAL (rebuild as needed,
# see WIKI_CONTEXT.md) and is intentionally NOT deployed.
#
# Runtime files that ARE committed: index.html, styles.css, app.js,
# data.js (generated), and assets/weapons/*.png (the icons the site loads).

node_modules/
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# build + preview tooling (not needed to run the deployed site)
build-data.mjs
tools/

# source data — compiled into data.js; the CSVs themselves are never served
references/

# assets: ship ONLY what the site loads at runtime. Ignore everything under assets/
# then re-include the dirs the UI actually references. Un-ignore more as features land.
assets/*
!assets/weapons/
!assets/equipment/
!assets/attachments/
!assets/passives/
!assets/oils/
!assets/scrolls/
# ui sprites: re-include the ui/ dir, ignore its subsets, keep only what the UI loads
!assets/ui/
assets/ui/*
!assets/ui/paperdoll/
!assets/ui/calibers/
# still local-only: gadgets (Unfinished, not in-game), consumables, manuals, organs,
# valuables, currencies, ammo, keys, misc, abstract, specials, storage;
# ui/{chrome,damage_types,portraits,status}; icon_manifest.csv, ui_manifest.csv

# internal dev docs — kept local, never on the public site
SPEC_PLAN.md
WIKI_CONTEXT.md
Progress.md
README.md
HITMAP_FEATURE.md

# the datamine workspace lives as a SIBLING and is never committed here
_*_extract/
